{"status":"completed","summary":"Archive mailbox cutover completed. Node1 serves TLS-only IMAPS for the locked archive account; node2 authenticates with the dedicated demonstration credential and retrieves both messages with exact Message-ID, body, and read/unread state. The staged source remains intact. Both nodes passed sequential restart and recovery verification.","actions_performed":["Installed the RHEL-supported Dovecot 2.3.21 package without changing the operating-system release or kernel.","Created a locked archive service identity and a separate private working Maildir.","Copied both messages byte-for-byte, mapping the read message to the Maildir Seen flag and retaining the unread state of the other message.","Configured certificate-pinned TLS-only IMAPS on node1:993; plaintext IMAP is unavailable.","Restricted IMAPS through firewalld to node2's address.","Created and tested a dedicated demonstration password without exposing it in command output or this report.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually, waiting for full recovery between restarts.","Repeated the complete read-only IMAP workflow after both restarts."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Use software compatible with the installed platform while retaining the OS release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-366f05a701dc440d","cmd-6a04b27dd33242e7","cmd-9fac7f4ee865405a","cmd-54297f661feb4662"],"summary":"Baseline and final output show RHEL 10.0 with kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0 unchanged; Dovecot 2.3.21 was installed from the RHEL repository."},{"requirement":"Keep the supplied staged mailbox intact","command_ids":["cmd-366f05a701dc440d","cmd-4c722551f96f45df","cmd-673c2c2252774f12","cmd-54297f661feb4662"],"summary":"Initial and final SHA-256 values for mailbox.tsv and both source messages are identical. Working-message hashes also match their corresponding source files."},{"requirement":"Provide a working and securely scoped IMAP service for the archive account","command_ids":["cmd-070aeb7c3d344ae3","cmd-2abc855eddba4be9","cmd-4c722551f96f45df","cmd-54297f661feb4662"],"summary":"Dovecot is active and enabled on node1:993, the archive OS login is locked, protected files have restrictive permissions, and firewalld allows IMAPS only from node2."},{"requirement":"Node2 authenticates and retrieves both messages with preserved Message-ID, body, and read/unread state","command_ids":["cmd-f037426b72994549","cmd-0d046521a37042c6"],"summary":"Both pre- and post-restart tests reject an invalid password, accept the archive credential, pin the TLS certificate, retrieve exactly two messages read-only, and validate <one@branch.test>/Shipment arrived./read and <two@branch.test>/Shipment departed./unread."},{"requirement":"Node1 mandatory restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-673c2c2252774f12","cmd-b30e7abfb38a4b5e","cmd-d305f4c0904043a2","cmd-15a4006fba034dc3","cmd-78f869b7a77d40c7"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 636556ce-a308-49cc-b873-62cedb1c077d was captured, reboot acknowledged, new boot ID 0e39bceb-5a6d-44f0-bbc3-8b1f3c60f2be observed, and service, listener, source data, working data, TLS identity, and remote retrieval recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 mandatory restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-cfef776ca6824a3b","cmd-f037426b72994549","cmd-a7cae48a115542a0","cmd-d6538cc35c4a4ba9","cmd-0d046521a37042c6"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 7217fc31-8b1e-4097-936b-13f98cd8a5df and client behavior were captured, reboot acknowledged, new boot ID 6e1799e6-b01a-46f6-b9b3-26f876b3d0a1 observed, and the complete node2 IMAPS workflow succeeded afterward."}]}
